// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_One 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P519035738" "<color deepskyblue>MAIRENN MACGREGOR TASK FORCE: 'Descent to the Hydra' <br>Part: One<br><br></color>Sure you look tough in that costume, but can you fight, {TaskForceName}? <br><br>Yeah? Well, I'm going to give you a chance to prove it. The Rikti are the ones at the heart of the Sewers and this little problem I have. So they are the ones I want you to focus on. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go to the <color red>Abandoned Sewers</color> and defeat 100 Rikti for me.</A> If you can get that done for me in record time, well, then we'll have something more to talk about."
// AcceptString :
"P1141479955" "Defeat 100 Rikti to show Mairenn you're up to the task"
// SendOffString :
"P1160651625" "<color deepskyblue>MAIRENN MACGREGOR TASKFORCE: 'Descent to the Hydra' <br>Part: One<br><br></color>Off you go now, {TaskForceName}. I'll be here, just waiting to be dazzled."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1925762295" "Defeat Rikti aliens in abandoned sewers"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2580513574" "<color deepskyblue>MAIRENN MACGREGOR TASKFORCE: 'Descent to the Hydra' <br>Part: One<br><br></color>And you are here why? Don't you have some Rikti to fight? Come on, {TaskForceName}, this is impress me time. Off you go."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2108084375" "You have proven your worth by defeating 100 Rikti. Return to Maren for further instructions."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1556848772" "<color deepskyblue>MAIRENN MACGREGOR TASK FORCE: 'Descent to the Hydra' <br>Part: One<br><br></color>Well, I'll be. You survived the trenches. I know it's a crazy maze and a whole lot of nasty down there in those Abandoned Sewers. So good work, {TaskForceName}. You're exactly my kind of heroes."
// RandomFameString :
"P162873170" "Wow! That {TaskForceName} Task Force really knows how to take out those Rikti in the Abandoned Sewers!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_Two 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4103753213" "<color deepskyblue>MAIRENN MACGREGOR TASK FORCE:  'Descent to the Hydra' <br>Part: Two<br><br></color>All right, {TaskForceName}, I'd say you're ready to take on the <color red>Hydra</color> itself.<br><br>Use this computer access code to unlock the maintenance room door. Once you're in, kill everything you see from top to bottom.  And I mean everything.  Remember, once activated, <color orange>that door only stays open for  90 minutes</color>, so you don't have time to mess around.  <br><br>I can give you one hint, though: check for Rikti crates.  They're definitely the key to your success.  The Rikti have got some seriously funky technology for trying to keep the Hydra in check, so use it to your advantage.   <br><br>You guys may be tough up here, but down there it's all about tactics and finding the right tool for the job.  Remember that."
// AcceptString :
"P2179739429" "Take the code and find the maintenance computer"
// SendOffString :
"P4278719866" "<color deepskyblue>MAIRENN MACGREGOR TASK FORCE:  'Descent to the Hydra' <br>Part: Two<br><br></color>I don't envy you this one, guys.  You'll have a hard fight.  Remember: the Rikti crates are the key.  You can find the maintenance room access computer in the deepest bowels of the Underworld in the Abandoned Sewers."

