"P3362323369" "<color deepskyblue>MAIRENN MACGREGOR TASK FORCE:  'Descent to the Hydra' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>Hey, you're back!  A Hydra eye?  For me?  Wow!  That's cool. <br><br>I'm glad to know you survived, and the Hydra is contained. For now, at least. I'm impressed, {TaskForceName}, and I don't impress easily."
